{title: Stand By Me}
{artist: Ben E. King}
{level: Easy}
{duration: 2.58}

{comment: Verse 1}
[A]When the night has come
And the [F#m]land is dark
And the [D]moon is the [E]only light we'll [A]see
[A]No I won't be afraid
No I [F#m]won't be afraid
Just as [D]long as you [E]stand, stand by [A]me

{comment: Chorus}
So darling, darling, [A]stand by me
Oh [F#m]stand by me
Oh [D]stand, [E]stand by me, [A]stand by me

{comment: Verse 2}
[A]If the sky that we look upon
Should [F#m]tumble and fall
Or the [D]mountain should [E]crumble to the [A]sea
[A]I won't cry, I won't cry
No I [F#m]won't shed a tear
Just as [D]long as you [E]stand, stand by [A]me
